## Why This Is Asked
This question evaluates design-level thinking for real-time, multi-region performance testing with streaming technologies and strict tail latency requirements.

## Key Concepts
- Tail latency optimization in streaming pipelines
- Data skew and hotspot mitigation strategies
- Backpressure management and circuit breaker patterns
- Autoscaling policies for multi-region deployments
- Comprehensive observability and validation frameworks

